m that turns on WHEN or by WHOM something was said, or whether it is still the current framing. Witness-depth sections below already carry full provenance.\n\nThis entry is BOUNDED — the whole graph is deliberately not inlined. Every node is reachable within a bounded number of expands: before concluding the perspective is silent on your subject, check the map and coverage, then expand the door whose axis would hold it (^Thematic for topics and areas, ^People for anyone, ^Documents for a call or memory, ^Unplaced for loose positions). Absence becomes signal only after the relevant door shows nothing.\n\n# The map — this graph's richest ground (top fidelity band)\n\n## ^GreenhouseMonitoring  [6 children · 20261009]\nSystematic microclimate tracking and sensor infrastructure across greenhouse bays\n  evidence 4 · sub-themes 2 — expand ^GreenhouseMonitoring for the full child index\n\n# Coverage — narrated, from four directions\n\nActive: [ Narrative_DayOldBreadMarkdownSynchronization · How should day-old bread discount timing and shelf signage updat… ^Narrative_DayOldBreadMarkdownSynchronization ] · [ Narrative_SensorDeploymentPrioritization · How should greenhouse sensor installations be sequenced against … ^Narrative_SensorDeploymentPrioritization ] — the newest witnessed work, one document each.\nUnplaced (2): [ Position_DayOldBreadMarkdownTimingAndSignage · how should the timing and shelf signage for day-old brea… ^Position_DayOldBreadMarkdownTimingAndSignage ] · [ Position_GreenhouseSensorDeploymentSequencing · what determines the rollout schedule and bay sequencing … ^Position_GreenhouseSensorDeploymentSequencing ] — positions waiting for the narrative that makes them meaningful; ^Unplaced holds them all.\n\n# Doors — pick an axis\n\n[ ^Thematic — every area (0) by name ] [ ^People 5 ] [ ^Dimensions — 0 axes ] [ ^Documents 2 ] [ ^Unplaced 2 ]\nEach door expands to a complete axis: aswritten_expand(iris=[\"Thematic\"]) — same coords as this perspective. Nothing in the graph is outside every door.\n\n# Focus: Ferry timetable change on weekdays from November, the passenger-load basis for ending the 22:40 late sailing, and the weekend exception retained by Tamsin Oduya and dispatcher Rolf Benedek. (witness depth — per-call section)\n\nNo direct match for this focus at witness depth — check the map, coverage, and doors above, and treat a genuine no-fit behind the relevant door as the perspective holding no position on it.\n","positions":"Position_DayOldBreadMarkdownTimingAndSignage — how should the timing and shelf signage for day-old bread price reductions be coordinated?\nPosition_GreenhouseSensorDeploymentSequencing — what determines the rollout schedule and bay sequencing for greenhouse sensors?","pin":"4d73530999011a4e44c232722b584ee2d26d589c","positions_consult":"{\"positions\":[{\"name\":\"Position_DayOldBreadMarkdownTimingAndSignage\",\"frame\":\"how should the timing and shelf signage for day-old bread price reductions be coordinated?\",\"narratives\":[],\"unplaced\":true,\"challenges\":[],\"members\":[{\"iri\":\"Expr_20261009_3_Batch2Bakery20261009050853_hff9ef5f7293e_1\",\"excerpt\":\"Day-old loaves go to half price at two in the afternoon, not at close. At close nobody is left to buy them.\"},{\"iri\":\"Expr_20261009_3_Batch2Bakery20261009050853_hff9ef5f7293e_2\",\"excerpt\":\"Then the shelf card changes at two as well, so the price is never a surprise at the till.\"}],\"source\":null,\"role\":\"unplaced\"},{\"name\":\"Position_GreenhouseSensorDeploymentSequencing\",\"frame\":\"what determines the rollout schedule and bay sequencing for greenhouse sensors?\",\"narratives\":[],\"unplaced\":true,\"challenges\":[],\"members\":[{\"iri\":\"Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_1\",\"excerpt\":\"We install humidity sensors in all four greenhouse bays before the first frost.\"},{\"iri\":\"Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_2\",\"excerpt\":\"Bay two gets the pilot unit first,